<title>SPAIN: Spain's Popular signs deal with Chile bank.</title>
<headline>Spain's Popular signs deal with Chile bank.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Popular has signed a cooperation agreement with Chile's Banco de Credito e Inversiones (BCI), it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The objective of this agreement is to attend respective clients' needs, putting at their disposal the banking products and financial services offered by the vast network of branches of the Banco Popular group and the foreign bank signing the accord,&quot; Popular said.</p>
<p>It has sent a representative to BCI's headquarters in Santiago de Chile, it said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
